    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you activate your Rage, and as a Bonus Action while your Rage is active, you can teleport up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. In addition, once per Rage, you can increase the range of that teleport to 150 feet and bring up to six willing creatures within 10 feet of you; each teleports to an unoccupied space of your choice within 10 feet of your destination.</p>",
